r occasions.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003eIt’s the signature of a man who takes himself seriously, every single day.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003eNotes\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003eTop Notes: Soft citrus freshness with aromatic nuances\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003eHeart Notes: Creamy sandalwood blended with warm leathery labdanum\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003eBase Notes: Deep woody amber accords enriched with smooth vanilla and refined woods\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003eBest For\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003eBusiness meetings and professional environments\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003eFormal and smart-casual looks\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003eEvening wear and elegant occasions\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eYear-round use, especially in moderate and cooler weather\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-02-27T15:40:44+02:00","created_at":"2026-02-27T14:52:54+02:00","updated_at":"2026-08-16T18:04:13+03:00","vendor":"Bleu De Chanel L’exclusif","product_type":"","tags":[],"variants":[{"id":42805930295344,"title":"30 ml","option1":"30 ml","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":false,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"750.00","gram